        509.7730407714844,
        293.7249450683594
      ],
      "text": "in resource-constrained and high TB and HIV-prevalence settings: 2015 update. Geneva: World Health",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        293.44940185546875,
        509.9841003417969,
        305.7234191894531
      ],
      "text": "Organization; 2015 (http://apps.who.int/iris/bitstream/10665/174052/1/9789241508872_eng.pdf).",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        311.119384765625,
        499.9520263671875,
        323.3934020996094
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines on the management of latent tuberculosis infection. Geneva: World Health Organization;",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        96.37870788574219,
        323.1178894042969,
        421.4812927246094,
        335.39190673828125
      ],
      "text": "2015 (http://apps.who.int/medicinedocs/documents/s21682en/s21682en.pdf).",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.39190673828125,
        526.6691284179688,
        396.19189453125
      ],
      "text": "therapy for people living with HIV in resource-constrained settings as well as recommendations on the use of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.39190673828125,
        526.7073974609375,
        410.19189453125
      ],
      "text": "LTBI testing. Other relevant recommendations approved by the guideline review committee are also included",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        74.90609741210938,
        411.3319091796875,
        98.24009704589844,
        424.26190185546875
      ],
      "text": "Box 1",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.39190673828125,
        526.67431640625,
        424.19189453125
      ],
      "text": "( ). The guidelines presented here are the most recent and most comprehensive WHO guidelines for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.39190673828125,
        526.7192993164062,
        438.19189453125
      ],
      "text": "programmatic management of LTBI. They are expected to provide the basis and rationale for the development",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.39190673828125,
        526.6723022460938,
        452.19189453125
      ],
      "text": "of national guidelines for LTBI management, adapted to the national and local epidemiology of TB, the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.39190673828125,
        453.02435302734375,
        466.19189453125
      ],
      "text": "availability of resources, the health infrastructure and other national and local determinants.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.3507995605469,
        143.5828857421875,
        498.1338195800781
      ],
      "text": "1.4\t Target",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.069091796875,
        526.6712036132812,
        516.8690795898438
      ],
      "text": "The guidelines are to be used primarily in national TB and HIV control programmes or their equivalents in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.069091796875,
        526.6442260742188,
        530.8690795898438
      ],
      "text": "ministries of health and for other policy-makers working on TB and HIV and infectious diseases. They are",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.069091796875,
        526.6702270507812,
        544.8690795898438
      ],
      "text": "also appropriate for officials in other line ministries with work in the areas of health, including prison services,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.069091796875,
        526.71240234375,
        558.8690795898438
      ],
      "text": "social services and immigration (such as ministries of justice or correctional services) and clinicians and public",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        560.069091796875,
        526.7032470703125,
        572.8690795898438
      ],
      "text": "health practitioners working on TB, HIV, infectious diseases, prevention, child health and noncommunicable",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.069091796875,
        288.5861511230469,
        586.8690795898438
      ],
      "text": "diseases such as chronic kidney disease and cancer.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        602.0278930664062,
        275.0727233886719,
        618.8109130859375
      ],
      "text": "1.5\t Development of the guidelines",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.7462158203125,
        526.672119140625,
        637.5462036132812
      ],
      "text": "In conformity with the process recommended by the WHO guideline review committee  , three groups  (14)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        638.7462158203125,
        526.7042236328125,
        651.5462036132812
      ],
      "text": "were established: a guideline steering group, composed of WHO staff, including from regional offices; the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        652.7462158203125,
        526.6635131835938,
        665.5462036132812
      ],
      "text": "GDG, composed of a guideline methodologist, external content experts, national TB programme managers,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        666.7462158203125,
        526.7002563476562,
        679.5462036132812
      ],
      "text": "academicians and representatives of patient groups and civil society, who provided input at all stages of the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        680.7462158203125,
        526.6951904296875,
        693.5462036132812
      ],
      "text": "process; and the external review group, composed of experts with interest in LTBI, who reviewed the draft",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        694.7462158203125,
        115.63507080078125,
        707.5462036132812
      ],
      "text": "guidelines.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        714.4161987304688,
        526.705078125,
        727.2161865234375
      ],
      "text": "The steering group prepared the scoping document for the guidelines, which identified key questions in PICO",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        728.4161987304688,
        526.6283569335938,
        741.2161865234375
      ],
      "text": "(population, intervention, comparator, outcomes) format, the systematic reviews required as a basis for the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        742.4161987304688,
        526.7033081054688,
        755.2161865234375
      ],
      "text": "recommendations and the process for preparing the guidelines. The group also considered questions on",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        756.4161987304688,
        472.5032958984375,
        769.2161865234375
      ],
      "text": "aspects of programmatic management of LTBI for which new evidence was likely to be available.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        47.54100036621094,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.69300079345703,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "6",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
